How to get dispatch_ready? For schedule candidates, we can get via finalize_candidate_direct (sets dispatch_ready) or finalize_candidate_after_* etc. For origin/destination availability, there are actions mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready. Preconditions: origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready. Effect: dispatch_ready. Similarly for destination.

