Thus order: prepare origin and destination (prepare, attach task profile, load payload, unload payload) -> we will have locked and confirmed.

But note: load action sets locked, but we need confirmed via unload. So after load+unload we have locked and confirmed.

Now we need to activate nodes before load (to get ready). So we need to activate origin node before loading origin payload, and activate destination node before loading destination payload.

