Now after these, we have origin and destination availability locked and confirmed, nodes ready and occupied.

Now we need to assemble transport leg: assemble_transport_leg requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available.

