We also need to allocate dispatch slot for alpha and execute dispatch.

Now we also need to ensure that we don't conflict with resource usage: e.g., operator resource can only be linked to one candidate at a time (since assigning consumes availability). We'll need to link to alpha, do alignment, then release operator, then link to beta.

